[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21556.31, "timestamp": "05:59:16", "text": "。那是因為你……你現在靜音了，然後你向下移動了。所以，當我跟你打招呼時，你沒有回复。我當時就想，等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21558.07, "timestamp": "05:59:18", "text": "她為什麼要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21560.07, "timestamp": "05:59:20", "text": "躲避？  所以我這麼做了。  我想做一些事情。我們一直在胡鬧，太過了。我們玩得太過火了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21583.59, "timestamp": "05:59:43", "text": "。或許我們"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21587.18, "timestamp": "05:59:47", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6Qoremember to hydrate"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21587.75, "timestamp": "05:59:47", "text": "應該放鬆一下，你知道嗎？是的。什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21597.27, "timestamp": "05:59:57", "text": "但如果這個人感染了我們怎麼辦？  太近了。太近了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21598.868, "timestamp": "05:59:58", "text": "太近了。我的天啊。那邊有人去世了。"}]